      "lines": [
        "在发电站，用汽轮机带动发电机. 汽轮机轴的转速可达",
        "每分钟 3000 转，是适于带动发电机的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在在苏联的一些工厂里可以生产功率达 1200000 千瓦",
        "的汽轮机."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "汽轮机通常用于热电站及舰艇上."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用燃气取代蒸汽做工质的燃气轮机逐渐得到越来越广泛",
        "的应用."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**问题**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(1) 什么样的热机叫做汽轮机？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(2) 汽轮机在结构上和活塞式发动机有什么不同？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**112**. **热机效率**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所有的热机都只能把燃料释放出的能量的一部分转换为",
        "机械能. 这是因为做完功之后从热机中排出来的燃气或蒸",
        "汽，还是具有能量的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**用于使热机做出有用功的那部分能量与燃料充分燃烧所**",
        "**释放出来的总能量之比**，**叫做热机效率**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "通常用百分数来表示热机效率. 内燃机的效率为 $20-↵40\\%$，而汽轮机的效率约为 $30\\%$."
      ]
    },
    {
